# Started by hand (ssh, a script): no launcher contract and no input.state (APP-CONTRACT section 7). The app starts,
# sizes itself from the layout service and the System page says "no contract".
title System Monitor: started without the launcher
nocontract
env SYSTEM_MONITOR_FIXTURE pi-zero-2w:busy
sizes 640x480 720x720

wait 600
shot overview-nocontract
key up
key up
wait 400
key enter
wait 800
key up
wait 600
shot about-nocontract
expect text "no contract"
key esc
key esc
expect quit
